OL,3,GNEWSA'Too hot for ice cream' - summer's
OL,4,Aimpact on trade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis summer's hot weather has led to
OL,7,Fmixed fortunes for businesses as they
OL,8,Fdealt with the positive and negative
OL,9,Fimpacts of record-breaking conditions.
OL,11,FSome traders in south-west England and
OL,12,Fthe Channel Islands said they
OL,13,Fbenefitted from higher visitor numbers
OL,14,Fand increased demand for food and
OL,15,Fbeverages, but others faced challenges
OL,16,Fas a result of prolonged dry
OL,17,Fconditions.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
